  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/01/IMG_9831.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La sala de exposiciones del patio de la Caja Rural de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este jueves una nueva charla organizada por la asociaci&oacute;n Popar i criar, a cargo de la psicopedagoga Rosa Barcel&oacute;, sobre Celos entre hermanos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradapoparicriarcelsentregermanses/img_9831.jpg\" alt=\"img_9831\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradapoparicriarcelsentregermanses/img_9833.jpg\" alt=\"img_9833\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradapoparicriarcelsentregermanses/img_9834.jpg\" alt=\"img_9834\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradapoparicriarcelsentregermanses/img_9835.jpg\" alt=\"img_9835\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradapoparicriarcelsentregermanses/img_9836.jpg\" alt=\"img_9836\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradapoparicriarcelsentregermanses/img_9837.jpg\" alt=\"img_9837\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
